flowchart TD
    A([🧠 PLAN\nRequirements, Stories,\nSprint Planning]) --> B

    B([💻 CODE\nJava + Spring Boot\nThymeleaf + H2]) --> C

    C([🔀 VERSION CONTROL\nGit Commit\nFeature Branch]) --> D

    D{Code Review\nPull Request} -->|Approved| E
    D -->|Changes Needed| B

    E([🔨 BUILD\nJenkins triggers\nmvn clean compile]) --> F{Build OK?}

    F -->|❌ FAIL| FAIL1([🚫 Build FAILED\nNotify Developer\nStop Pipeline])
    F -->|✅ PASS| G

    G([🧪 UNIT + INTEGRATION TEST\nJUnit + Spring Boot Test\nmvn test]) --> H{Tests Pass?}

    H -->|❌ FAIL| FAIL2([🚫 Test FAILED\nNotify Developer\nStop Pipeline])
    H -->|✅ PASS| I

    I([📦 PACKAGE\nmvn package\nCreate JAR]) --> J

    J([🚀 DEPLOY\nJenkins deploys JAR\nor Docker Container]) --> K

    K([🌐 BROWSER TEST\nSelenium WebDriver\nEnd-to-End Tests]) --> L{E2E Tests Pass?}

    L -->|❌ FAIL| FAIL3([🚫 E2E FAILED\nRoll Back\nNotify Developer])
    L -->|✅ PASS| M

    M([✅ VERIFY / MONITOR\nHealth Check\nSpring Boot Actuator]) --> N{Healthy?}

    N -->|❌ FAIL| FAIL4([🔄 RECOVER\nAnsible/Puppet\nRestart or Roll Back])
    N -->|✅ PASS| O([🎉 DONE\nRelease Successful])

    FAIL4 --> J

